# Version control
.git
.gitignore

# Dependencies & build output (installed/built inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
.pnpm-store
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Env & secrets (never bake these into an image)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Editor / agent tooling (not part of the application)
.claude
.agents
.windsurf
**/.claude
**/.agents
**/.windsurf
**/skills-lock.json

# Local dev artifacts
**/*.log
apps/api/dev.db
apps/api/uploads

# Misc
*.md
!README.md
